OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreads southeast, heaviest in western
OL,7,FScotland. Brighter conditions follow
OL,8,Fwith showers, some heavy and thundery.
OL,9,FWindy at times. Very warm on Sunday,
OL,10,Fthen turning cooler for the coming
OL,11,Fdays.
